window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-mashima-tomonari"]=[{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v3-p24-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 2 sec  2 1  the announcement that erases the vacation a prepared white platform on the beach  uniformed adults setting up a tent and computers behind him  introduced as class a s homeroom teacher  english   well known for having a stubborn disposition  built like a wrestler but  actually quite intelligent    and he opens grim   it s unfortunate that one of you was unable to participate due to illness   well then  we shall commence the current academic year s first special test   this test will determine if you can live on a deserted island together as a group  designed based on real world corporate training  answers ike s disbelief without contempt for the complaint itself  only for its basis    you ve lived a short  superficial life  there is an actual  prominent company that holds training sessions on uninhabited islands  concedes the process complaint where he didn t concede the disbelief   i suppose that you re not wrong about that  i can understand why you would be discontented  sets the theme that names the chapter   the theme of this special exam is  freedom  after all  hands out the three hundred point budget and the manual  frames the week as playable  names the stakes   remaining points convert to class points after vacation   and the class a illness penalty  thirty points  leaving a at 270","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v3-p24-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.1: the announcement that erases the vacation<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.24–29<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">A prepared white platform on the beach; uniformed adults setting up a tent and computers behind him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Well then. We shall commence the current academic year’s first special test.”<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“This test will determine if you can live on a deserted island together as a group… designed based on real-world corporate training.”<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">Sets the theme that names the chapter: &quot;The theme of this special exam is ‘freedom’, after all.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27–28<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Post<\/span> Introduced as Class A&#x27;s homeroom teacher, English, &quot;well-known for having a stubborn disposition,&quot; built like a wrestler but &quot;actually quite intelligent&quot; — and he opens grim: &quot;it’s unfortunate that one of you was unable to participate due to illness.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Answers Ike&#x27;s disbelief without contempt for the complaint itself, only for its basis — &quot;you’ve lived a short, superficial life. There is an actual, prominent company that holds training sessions on uninhabited islands.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.26–27<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Concedes the process complaint where he didn&#x27;t concede the disbelief: &quot;I suppose that you’re not wrong about that. I can understand why you would be discontented.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Hands out the three-hundred-point budget and the manual; frames the week as playable.<span class=\"pg\">p.27–28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Names the stakes — remaining points convert to class points after vacation — and the Class A illness penalty: thirty points, leaving A at 270.<span class=\"pg\">p.28–29<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v3-p243-1\">→ After: Ch.7: the results announcement<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v3-p243-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"action spoken","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 7  the results announcement cuts the beach argument short with a megaphone and announces the special test s results to all four classes  appears on the beach with a megaphone the moment its click cuts the argument short   it s fine  we don t mind if you want to keep relaxing  the test has already concluded  now we ve entered the summer vacation part of the trip  so it s all right if you loosen up   well then  to get straight to the point  i would like to announce the results of the special test   we will not accept any questions regarding the results  no exceptions  we would like you to accept the results you have been given  analyze them  and use them to help you for the next test  it is what it is  don t wet yourselves over these results  you must accept reality  you know   now  we will announce the rankings  the lowest class is class c  with zero points   in third place is class a  with 120 points  coming in second place is class b  with 140 points   has come in first with 225 points  this concludes the announcement  class d takes first with 225 points  class b second with 140  class a third with 120  class c last with zero  the broken three quarter mark in the class c line and the clipped opening before  has come in first  are kept as printed","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v3-p243-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: the results announcement<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.243–244<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Cuts the beach argument short with a megaphone and announces the special test’s results to all four classes.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“It’s fine. We don’t mind if you want to keep relaxing. The test has already concluded. Now we’ve entered the summer vacation part of the trip, so it’s all right if you loosen up.”<span class=\"pg\">p.243<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Well then, to get straight to the point. I would like to announce the results of the special test.”<span class=\"pg\">p.243<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“We will not accept any questions regarding the results, no exceptions. We would like you to accept the results you have been given, analyze them, and use them to help you for the next test. It is what it is. Don’t wet yourselves…”<span class=\"pg\">p.243<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Appears on the beach with a megaphone the moment its click cuts the argument short.<span class=\"pg\">p.242<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “We will not accept any questions regarding the results, no exceptions. We would like you to accept the results you have been given, analyze them, and use them to help you for the next test. It is what it is. Don’t wet yourselves over these results. You must accept reality, you know?”<span class=\"pg\">p.243<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Now, we will announce the rankings. The lowest class is¾Class C, with zero points.”<span class=\"pg\">p.244<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In third place is Class A, with 120 points. Coming in second place is Class B, with 140 points.”<span class=\"pg\">p.244<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “…has come in first with 225 points. This concludes the announcement.”<span class=\"pg\">p.244<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Class D takes first with 225 points, Class B second with 140, Class A third with 120, Class C last with zero.<span class=\"pg\">p.244<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The broken three-quarter mark in the Class C line and the clipped opening before “has come in first” are kept as printed.<span class=\"pg\">p.244<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v3-p24-1\">← Before: Ch.2 sec. 2.1: the announcement that erases the vacation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p32-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae karuizawa-kei mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 2 sec  2 3  the zodiac briefing briefs the four class d students in room 204  zodiac groups  thinking tested four ways   what are you doing  hurry and take a seat   we are still waiting on one more  please sit quietly   i believe you were told punctuality was key  and yet you re late  hurry and take your seat   sotomura  yukimura  ayanokouji  and karuizawa  from class d  without further ado  i will now explain the special test   i will not answer any questions at this time  be quiet and listen   in this special test  all the first year students will be divided into twelve groups based on the signs of the zodiac  names the four tested abilities  processing information  analyzing the situation  solving after clarifying  and creating new values through imagination   society needs three fundamental qualities in order to progress  action  thinking  and teamwork  those with the necessary qualities will become wonderful adults   i ve already told you  i will not be answering any questions   you four gathered here will be in the same group  at this very moment  students in other rooms are receiving the same explanation you are   calm down  you two  yukimura  your concerns are groundless  the test hasn t yet begun  so you won t be affected  besides  your attitude has no bearing on this test  cold and unanswerable  the narrator pits him against chabashira   she  unmotivated and unnaturally uncooperative  he  impossible to read  the comparison the narrator draws between the two homeroom instructors  warns her twice before shutting her questions down","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p32-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.3: the zodiac briefing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.32–36<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Briefs the four Class D students in Room 204: zodiac groups, thinking tested four ways.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“What are you doing? Hurry and take a seat.”<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“We are still waiting on one more. Please sit quietly.”<span class=\"pg\">p.33<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I believe you were told punctuality was key, and yet you’re late. Hurry and take your seat”<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Sotomura, Yukimura, Ayanokouji, and Karuizawa, from Class D. Without further ado, I will now explain the special test.”<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I will not answer any questions at this time. Be quiet and listen.”<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In this special test, all the first-year students will be divided into twelve groups based on the signs of the Zodiac.”<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Names the four tested abilities: processing information, analyzing the situation, solving after clarifying, and creating new values through imagination.<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Society needs three fundamental qualities in order to progress: action, thinking, and teamwork. Those with the necessary qualities will become wonderful adults.”<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’ve already told you. I will not be answering any questions.”<span class=\"pg\">p.35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You four gathered here will be in the same group. At this very moment, students in other rooms are receiving the same explanation you are.”<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Calm down, you two. Yukimura, your concerns are groundless. The test hasn’t yet begun, so you won’t be affected. Besides, your attitude has no bearing on this test.”<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cold and unanswerable; the narrator pits him against Chabashira — she “unmotivated and unnaturally uncooperative,” he “impossible to read.”<span class=\"pg\">p.32–36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> The comparison the narrator draws between the two homeroom instructors.<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Warns her twice before shutting her questions down.<span class=\"pg\">p.34–35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p37-1\">→ After: Ch.2 sec. 2.3: the handout and the four outcomes<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p37-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei yukimura-teruhiko mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 2 sec  2 3  the handout and the four outcomes carries the briefing to its end  cross class groups  the printed roster  the vip handout  werewolf  and the meeting logistics   listen  your group assignments are a done deal  you cannot change them  to gain a good result on the test  you must get along   finished  please let me continue my explanation   it would appear that you cannot help but be concerned by this small gathering  therefore  i will try to provide an answer  this is neither a conspiracy against the students  nor is it harassment  it s rather simple  the groups don t consist of members from just one class  they are made up of about three to five individuals collected from each class  if we didn t explain things in advance  we would run the risk of confusion   you ve been competing until now  your school lives have only just begun  you shouldn t run around like a chicken with its head cut off this early  yukimura   right now  you shouldn t spend your energy on trying to understand this test  rather  focus on how to think  your group assignment is  rabbit  here is a list of the members  you will be required to return this list when you leave the room  if you feel it s necessary  i would recommend trying to memorize it now   don t worry  i will answer any questions you have  i believe you will be able to understand everything afterward  probably   the point of this test is to ignore the prior fraught relationships between classes a through d  if you do  you ll have a shortcut   from this point on  you are no longer acting as members of class d  but rather as members of the rabbit group  whether you pass or fail this test depends on each group  four outcomes only  handouts of the grade items may be verified on the spot but not taken  photographed  or copied  the test runs from 8 00 a m  day one s message to 9 00 p m  day four  two one hour group meetings daily at set times and rooms  answers accepted only 9 30 10 00 p m  the final night  by email  first submission per group counts  one answer per student  vips may not submit  results emailed 11 00 p m  outcome  1  a correct final answer pays every group member 500 000 private points  outcome  2  no or wrong final submission pays only the vip 500 000   this exam has one critical element  understand it  and this test will not pose a problem  the key element is the existence of the vip  there is only one vip in the group  in this test  you re after the name of the vip  it s that simple  for example  yukimura  let s say that you were chosen as vip  the correct answer for the rabbit group would be  yukimura   now then  as for outcome  2  in the event that the vip s identity is not discovered before the end of the examination  and no one in your group found out the identity of the vip or some even attempted to lie about the identity  then only the vip will be awarded points  just as it says  he or she will receive 500 000 points   did you understand the explanation for the first two  if you do not  then we cannot continue   regarding the remaining outcomes  they are written on the reverse side of the handout  however  please wait a bit before turning the paper over   very well  i will explain in simpler terms  have you played the game werewolf   although i said that there is only one vip in the group  if the vip is exposed right away  then outcomes  3 and  4 will appear  outcome  3  an early correct answer by a non vip pays that student 500 000 private points and their class 50 class points  costs the vip s class 50  and ends the group s test   a vip classmate s early correct answer doesn t count  outcome  4  an early wrong answer by a non vip costs their class 50 class points and pays the vip 500 000 plus 50 to the vip s class   a vip classmate s early wrong answer doesn t count   the school will take anonymity into account during this test  at the end  only the outcomes for each group and the increase or decrease in points for each class will be announced  in other words  we will not announce the names of the vips or those who submitted answers  also  if you wish  you may have a temporary id assigned to you  to which you can transfer points  it is also possible to divide points up and receive them that way  if you yourself remain quiet  there should be no fear of discovery after the test  of course  if it s not necessary for you to hide your identity  you may receive your points openly  that is perfectly fine   outcomes  3 and  4 are very different from the first two  that s why they are listed on the reverse side of the sheet  with that  the explanation is complete   there should also be a list of prohibited actions on the sheet  make sure to examine it thoroughly  prohibited  stealing phones  threats to confirm vip information  using another s phone to submit   up to expulsion  cross class discussion until the exam ends   expulsion  school messages may not be copied  deleted  transferred  or modified   tomorrow  you will go to your designated room at 1 00 p m  and again at 8 00 p m  your group s name will be displayed on a nameplate  be sure to introduce yourselves when you meet the other members for the first time  after you ve entered  leaving the room during the examination is not permitted  please use the restroom ahead of time  in the event that you feel ill or can t endure it any longer  please contact your homeroom teacher immediately and make a request   the explanation is written on the sheet  the discussion period is for one hour  aside from self introduction upon your initial meeting  you are free to use that time however you like  once the hour has passed  you are free to remain in the room or to leave   the school is committed to fairness  so we will be strict and impartial  after the vip has been selected  we will not accept any changes  not even if the vip wants to be changed  in addition  copying  deleting  transferring  or modifying emails sent from the school is prohibited  understand these points clearly  flat  unchanging tone throughout  sharp eyed when they reach for the paper    it seemed like the exam had already begun  absorbs her four interruptions without expression  cuts his chicken with its head short speech down","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p37-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.3: the handout and the four outcomes<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.37–49<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Carries the briefing to its end: cross-class groups, the printed roster, the VIP handout, Werewolf, and the meeting logistics.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Listen. Your group assignments are a done deal. You cannot change them. To gain a good result on the test, you must get along.”<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Finished? Please let me continue my explanation.”<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It would appear that you cannot help but be concerned by this small gathering. Therefore, I will try to provide an answer. This is neither a conspiracy against the students, nor is it harassment. It’s rather simple. The groups…”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>26 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It would appear that you cannot help but be concerned by this small gathering. Therefore, I will try to provide an answer. This is neither a conspiracy against the students, nor is it harassment. It’s rather simple. The groups don’t consist of members from just one class; they are made up of about three to five individuals collected from each class. If we didn’t explain things in advance, we would run the risk of confusion.”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You’ve been competing until now? Your school lives have only just begun. You shouldn’t run around like a chicken with its head cut off this early, Yukimura.”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Right now, you shouldn’t spend your energy on trying to understand this test. Rather, focus on how to think. Your group assignment is ‘Rabbit’. Here is a list of the members. You will be required to return this list when you leave the room. If you feel it’s necessary, I would recommend trying to memorize it now.”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Don’t worry. I will answer any questions you have. I believe you will be able to understand everything afterward. Probably.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “The point of this test is to ignore the prior fraught relationships between Classes A through D. If you do, you’ll have a shortcut.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “From this point on, you are no longer acting as members of Class D, but rather as members of the Rabbit group. Whether you pass or fail this test depends on each group.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Four outcomes only; handouts of the grade items may be verified on the spot but not taken, photographed, or copied.<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> The test runs from 8:00 a.m. day one’s message to 9:00 p.m. day four; two one-hour group meetings daily at set times and rooms; answers accepted only 9:30–10:00 p.m. the final night, by email, first submission per group counts, one answer per student, VIPs may not submit, results emailed 11:00 p.m.<span class=\"pg\">p.40–41<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Outcome #1: a correct final answer pays every group member 500,000 private points. Outcome #2: no or wrong final submission pays only the VIP 500,000.<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “This exam has one critical element. Understand it, and this test will not pose a problem. The key element is the existence of the VIP. There is only one VIP in the group. In this test, you’re after the name of the VIP. It’s that simple. For example, Yukimura, let’s say that you were chosen as VIP. The correct answer for the Rabbit group would be ‘Yukimura.’”<span class=\"pg\">p.41<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Now then, as for Outcome #2… In the event that the VIP’s identity is not discovered before the end of the examination, and no one in your group found out the identity of the VIP or some even attempted to lie about the identity, then only the VIP will be awarded points, just as it says. He or she will receive 500,000 points.”<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Did you understand the explanation for the first two? If you do not, then we cannot continue.”<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Regarding the remaining outcomes, they are written on the reverse side of the handout. However, please wait a bit before turning the paper over.”<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Very well, I will explain in simpler terms. Have you played the game Werewolf?”<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Although I said that there is only one VIP in the group, if the VIP is exposed right away, then Outcomes #3 and #4 will appear.”<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Outcome #3: an early correct answer by a non-VIP pays that student 500,000 private points and their class 50 class points, costs the VIP’s class 50, and ends the group’s test — a VIP-classmate’s early correct answer doesn’t count. Outcome #4: an early wrong answer by a non-VIP costs their class 50 class points and pays the VIP 500,000 plus 50 to the VIP’s class — a VIP-classmate’s early wrong answer doesn’t count.<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “The school will take anonymity into account during this test. At the end, only the outcomes for each group and the increase or decrease in points for each class will be announced. In other words, we will not announce the names of the VIPs or those who submitted answers. Also, if you wish, you may have a temporary ID assigned to you, to which you can transfer points. It is also possible to divide points up and receive them that way. If you yourself remain quiet, there should be no fear of discovery after the test. Of course, if it’s not necessary for you to hide your identity, you may receive your points openly. That is perfectly fine.”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Outcomes #3 and #4 are very different from the first two. That’s why they are listed on the reverse side of the sheet. With that, the explanation is complete.”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “There should also be a list of prohibited actions on the sheet. Make sure to examine it thoroughly.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> Prohibited: stealing phones, threats to confirm VIP information, using another’s phone to submit — up to expulsion; cross-class discussion until the exam ends — expulsion; school messages may not be copied, deleted, transferred, or modified.<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Tomorrow, you will go to your designated room at 1:00 p.m. and again at 8:00 p.m. Your group’s name will be displayed on a nameplate… Be sure to introduce yourselves when you meet the other members for the first time. After you’ve entered, leaving the room during the examination is not permitted. Please use the restroom ahead of time. In the event that you feel ill or can’t endure it any longer, please contact your homeroom teacher immediately and make a request.”<span class=\"pg\">p.49-50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “The explanation is written on the sheet. The discussion period is for one hour. Aside from self-introduction upon your initial meeting, you are free to use that time however you like. Once the hour has passed, you are free to remain in the room or to leave.”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “The school is committed to fairness, so we will be strict and impartial. After the VIP has been selected, we will not accept any changes, not even if the VIP wants to be changed. In addition, copying, deleting, transferring, or modifying emails sent from the school is prohibited. Understand these points clearly.”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Flat, unchanging tone throughout; sharp-eyed when they reach for the paper — “It seemed like the exam had already begun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.41–43<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Absorbs her four interruptions without expression.<span class=\"pg\">p.37–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Cuts his chicken-with-its-head-short speech down.<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p32-1\">← Before: Ch.2 sec. 2.3: the zodiac briefing<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p67-1\">→ After: Ch.3: the phrasing he still hears<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p67-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 3  the phrasing he still hears one backward glance at her briefing inside ayanokoji s vip message reading   mashima sensei had said something to the same effect  the vip had been chosen based on certain considerations  there was something about the chosen that set them apart    ayanokoji folds mashima s words into the email s  after thorough consideration  his reading of the vip rule still runs on her briefing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p67-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: the phrasing he still hears<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.67<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">One backward glance at her briefing inside Ayanokōji’s VIP-message reading.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Backstory<\/span> “Mashima-sensei had said something to the same effect. The VIP had been chosen based on certain considerations. There was something about the chosen that set them apart.” — Ayanokōji folds Mashima’s words into the email’s “After thorough consideration.”<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> His reading of the VIP rule still runs on her briefing.<span class=\"pg\">p.67<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p37-1\">← Before: Ch.2 sec. 2.3: the handout and the four outcomes<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p121-1\">→ After: Ch.3 sec. 3.6: the teachers’ sofa<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p121-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"spoken","w":"hoshinomiya-chie ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 3 sec  3 6  the teachers  sofa one of three homeroom instructors on the first level sofa   chabashira with a cocktail  hoshinomiya with whiskey  mashima beside them   while ayanokouji hides and listens  the opening lines of the table are untagged in the translation   you know  it s been a long time since the three of us all got together     it is what it is  fate  after bouncing around from one thing to the next  we all chose the teacher s life     enough  there s no point talking about that    the mashima playboy needle    chie  what happened to the man you were with    only hoshinomiya s break up line and mashima s  relax  i m not worried about that  are safely assigned by address or tag  the volume attribution list keeps the rest   ah ha ha  we broke up two weeks ago  i m the type of girl who breaks it off once the relationship starts getting serious  it s just like  see ya later  hoshinomiya sensei said   her own tagged line  kept here because the table is the scene   what are you planning  chie  addresses hoshinomiya  the speaker is not printed   likely chabashira or mashima  not assigned   i m not screwing around or anything  it s certainly true that as far as grades and attitude are concerned  ichinose san is number one  however  someone s true place in society cannot be measured by numbers alone  i determined that she needed a challenge  and besides  rabbits are just so cute  aren t they  the way they hop around  doesn t that suit ichinose san  hoshinomiya sensei asked   the ichinose in rabbit admission  tagged   we wouldn t want you to base your judgment on personal grudges  and the ten year bridge exchange sit between untagged speakers at the table   i see  mashima sensei nodded as though convinced of something  however  he then strictly addressed hoshinomiya sensei   there s no rule against this  but i want to be clear  stop spying on other colleagues  classes   both halves tagged to mashima  hoshinomiya s reply names sakagami over the class c dragon pick and says  they threw ryuuen in there  the closing  that s certainly true  this isn t your average year  the students seem rather special  is untagged  the drinking partner she needles and who orders her to stop spying colleagues  classes  the third seat  the strict order lands on him  named as the student hoshinomiya moved out of dragon  the student hoshinomiya admits watching since the island","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p121-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 sec. 3.6: the teachers’ sofa<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.121–123<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">One of three homeroom instructors on the first-level sofa — Chabashira with a cocktail, Hoshinomiya with whiskey, Mashima beside them — while Ayanokouji hides and listens.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hoshinomiya-chie.html\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ah ha ha! We broke up two weeks ago. I’m the type of girl who breaks it off once the relationship starts getting serious. It’s just like, see ya later!” Hoshinomiya-sensei said. (her own tagged line; kept here because the table…”<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’m not screwing around or anything. It’s certainly true that as far as grades and attitude are concerned, Ichinose-san is number one. However, someone’s true place in society cannot be measured by numbers alone. I determined…”<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I see.” Mashima-sensei nodded as though convinced of something. However, he then strictly addressed Hoshinomiya-sensei. “There’s no rule against this, but I want to be clear. Stop spying on other colleagues’ classes.” (both…”<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The opening lines of the table are untagged in the translation: “You know, it’s been a long time since the three of us all got together.” / “It is what it is. Fate. After bouncing around from one thing to the next, we all chose the teacher’s life.” / “Enough. There’s no point talking about that.” / the Mashima playboy needle / “Chie, what happened to the man you were with?” — only Hoshinomiya’s break-up line and Mashima’s “Relax. I’m not worried about that.” are safely assigned by address or tag; the volume attribution list keeps the rest.<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ah ha ha! We broke up two weeks ago. I’m the type of girl who breaks it off once the relationship starts getting serious. It’s just like, see ya later!” Hoshinomiya-sensei said. (her own tagged line; kept here because the table is the scene)<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “What are you planning, Chie?” addresses Hoshinomiya; the speaker is not printed — likely Chabashira or Mashima, not assigned.<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’m not screwing around or anything. It’s certainly true that as far as grades and attitude are concerned, Ichinose-san is number one. However, someone’s true place in society cannot be measured by numbers alone. I determined that she needed a challenge. And besides, rabbits are just so cute, aren’t they? The way they hop around. Doesn’t that suit Ichinose-san?” Hoshinomiya-sensei asked. (the Ichinose-in-Rabbit admission, tagged)<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “We wouldn’t want you to base your judgment on personal grudges.” and the ten-year-bridge exchange sit between untagged speakers at the table.<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I see.” Mashima-sensei nodded as though convinced of something. However, he then strictly addressed Hoshinomiya-sensei. “There’s no rule against this, but I want to be clear. Stop spying on other colleagues’ classes.” (both halves tagged to Mashima)<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Hoshinomiya’s reply names Sakagami over the Class C Dragon pick and says “they threw Ryuuen in there”; the closing “That’s certainly true. This isn’t your average year. The students seem rather special.” is untagged.<span class=\"pg\">p.122–123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/b> The drinking partner she needles and who orders her to stop spying colleagues’ classes.<span class=\"pg\">p.121–123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> The third seat; the strict order lands on him.<span class=\"pg\">p.121–123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Named as the student Hoshinomiya moved out of Dragon.<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The student Hoshinomiya admits watching since the island.<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v4-p67-1\">← Before: Ch.3: the phrasing he still hears<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v8-p11-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 2  named at the group report not on the bus briefing line  named when yamauchi s winning draw is reported to him as the class a entrant is finalised  passing mention   they reported to mashima sensei  after the first large group forms  chapter ends at the group report mention  no further pages this chapter","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: named at the group report<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.11–43<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Not on the bus briefing line; named when Yamauchi’s winning draw is reported to him as the Class A entrant is finalised.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention: “They reported to Mashima-sensei” after the first large group forms.<span class=\"pg\">p.42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Chapter ends at the group report mention; no further pages this chapter.<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p262-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"","w":"sakayanagi-arisu katsuragi-kouhei mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 6  class a vote as class a homeroom teacher explains the supplemental exam  then gives time for discussion  sakayanagi nominates katsuragi  quietly looks away as class a unanimously votes to expel katsuragi  oversees her class s decision to expel katsuragi  watches the vote to expel him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p262-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: Class A vote<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.262–263<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">As Class A homeroom teacher explains the supplemental exam, then gives time for discussion; Sakayanagi nominates Katsuragi. Quietly looks away as Class A unanimously votes to expel Katsuragi.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Oversees her class’s decision to expel Katsuragi.<span class=\"pg\">p.262–263<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Watches the vote to expel him.<span class=\"pg\">p.262–263<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p292-1\">→ After: Epilogue: Announcing Class A results<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p292-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"","w":"sakayanagi-arisu totsuka-yahiko katsuragi-kouhei mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari epilogue  announcing class a results announces the class a class poll results  naming sakayanagi first in praise votes  announces totsuka yahiko received 36 censure votes and will be expelled  tells totsuka the decision cannot be overturned and asks him to come to the staff room  answers sakayanagi s question about potential consequences and says they will not arise  announces results and responds to her question  announces his expulsion and escorts him  confirms the result when katsuragi protests","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p292-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Announcing Class A results<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.292–297<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Announces the Class A Class Poll results, naming Sakayanagi first in praise votes. Announces Totsuka Yahiko received 36 censure votes and will be expelled. Tells Totsuka the decision cannot be overturned and asks him to come to the staff room. Answers Sakayanagi’s question about potential consequences and says they will not arise.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"totsuka-yahiko.html\">Totsuka Yahiko<\/a> · <a href=\"katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Announces results and responds to her question.<span class=\"pg\">p.292, 297<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Totsuka Yahiko<\/b> Announces his expulsion and escorts him.<span class=\"pg\">p.293, 296<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Confirms the result when Katsuragi protests.<span class=\"pg\">p.293–296<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p262-1\">← Before: Ch.6: Class A vote<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p294-1\">→ After: Epilogue: Announcing Class A results<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p294-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"spoken","w":"katsuragi-kouhei totsuka-yahiko mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari epilogue  announcing class a results calmly confirms there were no mistakes when katsuragi protests totsuka s expulsion   there haven t been any mistakes  confirms the result when katsuragi protests  announces his expulsion","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p294-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Announcing Class A results<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.294<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Calmly confirms there were no mistakes when Katsuragi protests Totsuka’s expulsion.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"totsuka-yahiko.html\">Totsuka Yahiko<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“There haven’t been any mistakes.”<span class=\"pg\">p.294<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Confirms the result when Katsuragi protests.<span class=\"pg\">p.294<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Totsuka Yahiko<\/b> Announces his expulsion.<span class=\"pg\">p.293–294<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v10-p292-1\">← Before: Epilogue: Announcing Class A results<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p14-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"spoken","w":"tsukishiro chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 1  opposing the acting director breaks the silence in the staff meeting and questions acting director tsukishiro about the first years  exams  protests that the class vote creates a huge risk of expulsions and is inappropriate so soon after tsukishiro s appointment   forgive my rudeness  acting director  but you ve only just recently been appointed to your post at this school  although i understand you ve made this decision based on everything that has happened so far  i think it s somewhat inappropriate for us to do something that will force expulsions just because there haven t been any amongst the first years yet  argues the provisional exam is different from past policies and that expulsions should not be practically forced  asks tsukishiro to reconsider the provisional exam  but is shut down  listens as hoshinomiya and chabashira discuss the exam in the hallway  tries to mediate between chabashira and hoshinomiya over their past rivalry  warns hoshinomiya that class c is different this year  challenges his decision but fails to change it  speaks with her and hoshinomiya after the meeting  speaks with her after the meeting and warns her about class c   while the special exams for the second and third years are just as difficult as they had been in previous years  the special exam for the first years is far more difficult than usual  there s a huge risk that there will be expulsions because of this  class vote  provisional exam   if it s just about getting numerous students expelled  then wouldn t this exam do the same thing   no  this provisional exam is obviously different than the policies we ve had up until now  i cannot approve of something that practically forces expulsions   then  by any chance  could you at least reconsider it   are you two still fussing over what happened back then  how many years need to pass bef   be careful not to have the carpet pulled out from under you  this year s class d  no  class c is different from usual","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p14-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: Opposing the acting director<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.14–26<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Breaks the silence in the staff meeting and questions Acting Director Tsukishiro about the first-years’ exams. Protests that the Class Vote creates a huge risk of expulsions and is inappropriate so soon after Tsukishiro’s appointment. Argues the provisional exam is different from past policies and that expulsions should not be practically forced. Asks Tsukishiro to reconsider the provisional exam, but is shut down. Listens as Hoshinomiya and Chabashira discuss the exam in the hallway. Tries to mediate between Chabashira and Hoshinomiya over their past rivalry. Warns Hoshinomiya that Class C is different this year.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"hoshinomiya-chie.html\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Forgive my rudeness, Acting Director, but you’ve only just recently been appointed to your post at this school. Although I understand you’ve made this decision based on everything that has happened so far, I think it’s somewhat…”<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“While the special exams for the second and third years are just as difficult as they had been in previous years, the special exam for the first years is far more difficult than usual. There’s a huge risk that there will be…”<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“If it’s just about getting numerous students expelled, then wouldn’t this exam do the same thing?”<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Forgive my rudeness, Acting Director, but you’ve only just recently been appointed to your post at this school. Although I understand you’ve made this decision based on everything that has happened so far, I think it’s somewhat inappropriate for us to do something that will force expulsions just because there haven’t been any amongst the first-years yet.”<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Challenges his decision but fails to change it.<span class=\"pg\">p.14–19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Speaks with her and Hoshinomiya after the meeting.<span class=\"pg\">p.21–24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/b> Speaks with her after the meeting and warns her about Class C.<span class=\"pg\">p.21–26<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “While the special exams for the second and third years are just as difficult as they had been in previous years, the special exam for the first years is far more difficult than usual. There’s a huge risk that there will be expulsions because of this ‘Class Vote’ provisional exam…”<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “No. This provisional exam is obviously different than the policies we’ve had up until now. I cannot approve of something that practically forces expulsions.”<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Then, by any chance, could you at least reconsider it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Are you two still fussing over what happened back then? How many years need to pass befー”<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Be careful not to have the carpet pulled out from under you. This year’s Class D… No, Class C is different from usual.”<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p60-1\">→ After: Year 1, Vol. 11.5 Ch.1 — Depth review: confronting Tsukishiro&#x27;s manipulation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p60-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka chabashira-sae sakayanagi-arisu mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari year 1  vol  11 5 ch 1   depth review  confronting tsukishiro s manipulation joins ayanokoji and sakayanagi in a secret meeting with teachers mashima and chabashira during the closing ceremony   you seem to have something to say to us  ayanokouji  making a special announcement through chairman sakayanagi  allowing us to skip the closing ceremony to have a secret meeting  what s the big deal  what s going on   never mind what i think  the current situation is hard for anyone to accept   do you two have any evidence   yeah the part about how the father was dissatisfied with his child s decision to enrol into the school and tried to get him expelled  i believe  and i don t want to help him with that   are you trying to feel me out  ayanokouji   in future special examinations and tests  i will handle it appropriately  and will not allow   both these situations are connected  if something is considered dangerous to the students  i ll quickly stop it  if there s improper behaviour  i ll quickly see it corrected   i ve always consciously done my job as a teacher  strong sense of righteousness  accepted a pay cut for declaring class b s judo event a forfeit rather than risk an accident against yamada  and accepts he may be fired for opposing tsukishiro  hears the account of tsukishiro s interference and agrees to act against it  consults with her  warns her resisting tsukishiro could cost their jobs  notes her harshness  accepts her pledge to crush class d once tsukishiro is gone  his pay cut is explained as a result of the class b d event selection exam where he declared ichinose s judo forfeit against yamada","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p60-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Year 1, Vol. 11.5 Ch.1 — Depth review: confronting Tsukishiro&#x27;s manipulation<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · <\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Joins Ayanokōji and Sakayanagi in a secret meeting with teachers Mashima and Chabashira during the closing ceremony.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You seem to have something to say to us, Ayanokouji. Making a special announcement through Chairman Sakayanagi, allowing us to skip the closing ceremony to have a secret meeting… What&#x27;s the big deal? What&#x27;s going on?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Never mind what I think, the current situation is hard for anyone to accept.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Do you two have any evidence?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Yeah…The part about how the father was dissatisfied with his child&#x27;s decision to enrol into the school and tried to get him expelled, I believe. And I don&#x27;t want to help him with that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Are you trying to feel me out, Ayanokouji?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;In future special examinations and tests, I will handle it appropriately, and will not allow&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Both these situations are connected. If something is considered dangerous to the students, I&#x27;ll quickly stop it. If there&#x27;s improper behaviour, I&#x27;ll quickly see it corrected.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;ve always consciously done my job as a teacher.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Strong sense of righteousness; accepted a pay cut for declaring Class B&#x27;s judo event a forfeit rather than risk an accident against Yamada, and accepts he may be fired for opposing Tsukishiro.<span class=\"pg\">p.77–79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Hears the account of Tsukishiro&#x27;s interference and agrees to act against it.<span class=\"pg\">p.64–77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Consults with her, warns her resisting Tsukishiro could cost their jobs.<span class=\"pg\">p.70–79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Notes her harshness, accepts her pledge to crush Class D once Tsukishiro is gone.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–81<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> His pay cut is explained as a result of the Class B/D event-selection exam where he declared Ichinose&#x27;s judo forfeit against Yamada.<span class=\"pg\">p.78–79<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p14-1\">← Before: Ch.1: Opposing the acting director<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p62-1\">→ After: Ch.3: Explaining the commander system<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p62-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"kaneda-satoru chabashira-sae mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 3  explaining the commander system runs the lottery to decide which commander may choose an opponent  confirms the lottery results and kaneda s right to choose  finalizes the matchups as class d vs class b and class c vs class a  explains the commander s exam day procedures  including participant selection and time limits  warns that improper interference can lead to disqualification and explains headset text to speech rules  confirms his choice of opponent  explains the system alongside her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p62-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: Explaining the commander system<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.62–71<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Runs the lottery to decide which commander may choose an opponent. Confirms the lottery results and Kaneda’s right to choose. Finalizes the matchups as Class D vs Class B and Class C vs Class A. Explains the commander’s exam-day procedures, including participant selection and time limits. Warns that improper interference can lead to disqualification and explains headset/text-to-speech rules.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"kaneda-satoru.html\">Kaneda Satoru<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kaneda Satoru<\/b> Confirms his choice of opponent.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Explains the system alongside her.<span class=\"pg\">p.67–71<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p60-1\">← Before: Year 1, Vol. 11.5 Ch.1 — Depth review: confronting Tsukishiro&#x27;s manipulation<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p368-1\">→ After: Ch.8: Proctoring Class B vs Class D<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p368-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami ryuuen-kakeru mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 8  proctoring class b vs class d announces the results of the fourth event in the class b vs class d matchup  checks on the condition of class b students who reported feeling unwell  proceeds with the fifth event drawing at ryuen s insistence  rules the judo event a default loss for class b and declares class d the overall victor  reports results and rulings to her as class b s commander  oversees the matchup as he commands class d","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p368-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.8: Proctoring Class B vs Class D<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.368–374<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Announces the results of the fourth event in the Class B vs Class D matchup. Checks on the condition of Class B students who reported feeling unwell. Proceeds with the fifth event drawing at Ryūen’s insistence. Rules the Judo event a default loss for Class B and declares Class D the overall victor.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Reports results and rulings to her as Class B’s commander.<span class=\"pg\">p.368–374<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Oversees the matchup as he commands Class D.<span class=\"pg\">p.368–374<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11-p62-1\">← Before: Ch.3: Explaining the commander system<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11_5-p47-1","v":"y1v11.5","y":1,"o":14,"k":"","w":"tsukishiro sakayanagi-arisu ayanokouji-kiyotaka mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 1  chess exam meeting participates in the meeting with ayanokoji  sakayanagi  tsukishiro  and other teachers concerning the chess exam  hears sakayanagi claim that ayanokoji was the original winner of the chess game and that the process was manipulated  takes part in the teachers  response as the issue of acting director tsukishiro s interference is pressed  confronts the acting director over exam interference  hears her accusation regarding the chess exam  present in the meeting involving his exam","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11_5-p47-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: Chess exam meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11.5 · p.47–87<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Participates in the meeting with Ayanokōji, Sakayanagi, Tsukishiro, and other teachers concerning the chess exam. Hears Sakayanagi claim that Ayanokōji was the original winner of the chess game and that the process was manipulated. Takes part in the teachers’ response as the issue of Acting Director Tsukishiro’s interference is pressed.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Confronts the acting director over exam interference.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Hears her accusation regarding the chess exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Present in the meeting involving his exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–87<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11_5-p378-1\">→ After: Short story: Sakayanagi’s request<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11_5-p378-1","v":"y1v11.5","y":1,"o":14,"k":"","w":"sakayanagi-arisu ayanokouji-kiyotaka mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari short story  sakayanagi s request in sakayanagi s short story  mashima encounters her after the ceremonies and questions why she is waiting for him  he initially hesitates but agrees to let sakayanagi accompany him after she reveals knowledge of the meeting  is approached by her and takes her along toward the reception room  is headed to a meeting that involves him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11_5-p378-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Short story: Sakayanagi’s request<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11.5 · p.378–380<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In Sakayanagi’s short story, Mashima encounters her after the ceremonies and questions why she is waiting for him. He initially hesitates but agrees to let Sakayanagi accompany him after she reveals knowledge of the meeting.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Is approached by her and takes her along toward the reception room.<span class=\"pg\">p.378–380<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Is headed to a meeting that involves him.<span class=\"pg\">p.379–380<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y1v11_5-p47-1\">← Before: Ch.1: Chess exam meeting<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v1-p344-1","v":"y2v1","y":2,"o":16,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari epilogue  mention mentioned in passing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v1-p344-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V1 · p.344<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Mentioned in passing.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v3-p7-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v3-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.7-368<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v3-p16-1\">→ After: Mashima&#x27;s island exam briefing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v3-p16-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"spoken","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari mashima s island exam briefing class 2 a s homeroom teacher stands before the screen in the movie theater  microphone in hand  explaining the rules  with hoshinomiya handing him the watch   starting tomorrow  your stay on the island will last for the next two weeks   the first three groups to arrive at area c8 will receive an  early bird bonus  with the first receiving 10 points  the second receiving 5 points  and the third receiving 3 points   should a group fail to reach a designated area three times in a row  they will lose one point   starting tomorrow  all students will be required to wear one of these watches until the end of the exam   the school will continuously monitor the wearer s body temperature  heart rate  blood pressure  blood oxygen level  sleep cycle  stress levels  and so on   instead of a  warning alert  this final alert is known as an  emergency alert  methodical   explains the basic movement rule  designated areas  bonuses  penalties  the 12 table system  and demonstrates the health monitoring watch s warning emergency alerts  with a staff member fastening it  since special tools are needed  mashima notes only one member needs to reach a designated area to avoid the penalty  though the arrival bonus is per person","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v3-p16-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Mashima&#x27;s island exam briefing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.16–27<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class 2-A&#x27;s homeroom teacher stands before the screen in the movie theater, microphone in hand, explaining the rules (with Hoshinomiya handing him the watch).<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Starting tomorrow, your stay on the island will last for the next two weeks.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;The first three groups to arrive at area C8 will receive an &#x27;Early Bird Bonus&#x27;, with the first receiving 10 points, the second receiving 5 points, and the third receiving 3 points.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;should a group fail to reach a designated area three times in a row, they will lose one point.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Starting tomorrow, all students will be required to wear one of these watches until the end of the exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;the school will continuously monitor the wearer&#x27;s body temperature, heart rate, blood pressure, blood oxygen level, sleep cycle, stress levels, and so on.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Instead of a &#x27;Warning Alert&#x27;, this final alert is known as an &#x27;Emergency Alert&#x27;.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.25<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Methodical — explains the Basic Movement rule (designated areas, bonuses, penalties), the 12-table system, and demonstrates the health-monitoring watch&#x27;s Warning/Emergency alerts (with a staff member fastening it, since special tools are needed).<span class=\"pg\">p.16–27<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Mashima notes only one member needs to reach a designated area to avoid the penalty, though the Arrival Bonus is per person.<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v3-p7-1\">← Before: Full volume<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v4-p5-1","v":"y2v4","y":2,"o":19,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v4-p5-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4 · p.5-284<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v4_5-p10-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v4_5-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.10-290<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v4_5-p227-1\">→ After: Mashima reveals the next special exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v4_5-p227-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae hoshinomiya-chie mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari mashima reveals the next special exam sandwiched between the two women  sets down his half empty beer forcefully and warns that the second years  success  can invite trouble    not one second year has ever dropped out   it s not like the school wants anyone to drop out  but still  in reality  not even one of our second year students has dropped out of school during any special exams so far   the outline for the next special exam was announced recently  it will be implemented for the first time in 11 years   it s to make sure the contents of the special exams don t get leaked to other students while they re at school  right   you two suffered a great deal with this particular exam   even though class a is a head above of the rest  there s still a chance for those in class b and below to turn things around  sober and informative   explains the four year exam rotation and that the  problematic  exam from 11 years ago  their third year  has been reinstated because too few second years have dropped out  tries to defuse the tension between chabashira and hoshinomiya before leaving with the drunk hoshinomiya  fellow teacher  informs her of the exam and watches her go silent  drinks with her and ultimately escorts her home","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v4_5-p227-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Mashima reveals the next special exam<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.227–233<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sandwiched between the two women, sets down his half-empty beer forcefully and warns that the second-years&#x27; success &quot;can invite trouble&quot; — not one second-year has ever dropped out.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a> · <a href=\"hoshinomiya-chie.html\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s not like the school wants anyone to drop out, but still, in reality, not even one of our second-year students has dropped out of school during any special exams so far.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.227<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;The outline for the next special exam was announced recently. It will be implemented for the first time in 11 years.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s to make sure the contents of the special exams don&#x27;t get leaked to other students while they&#x27;re at school, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.229<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;you two suffered a great deal with this particular exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.231<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Even though Class A is a head above of the rest, there&#x27;s still a chance for those in Class B and below to turn things around.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sober and informative — explains the four-year exam rotation and that the &quot;problematic&quot; exam from 11 years ago (their third year) has been reinstated because too few second-years have dropped out; tries to defuse the tension between Chabashira and Hoshinomiya before leaving with the drunk Hoshinomiya.<span class=\"pg\">p.227–236<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Fellow teacher; informs her of the exam and watches her go silent.<span class=\"pg\">p.227–232<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/b> Drinks with her and ultimately escorts her home.<span class=\"pg\">p.232–236<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v4_5-p10-1\">← Before: Full volume<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v7-p7-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v7-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.7-207<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v8-p11-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.11-208<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9_5-p15-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka akiyama mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari mashima  gym training  and a favor to investigate akiyama at the gym he is pleased to find ayanokoji is now a member  shows him his bench press routine  80 100 kg  using safety bars  trains absorbed for two hours and accepts ayanokoji s advice to stop   hm  ayanokoji  are you a gym member too   when doing bench presses  never forget these safety bars  in the break room he asks ayanokoji to investigate a gym employee  akiyama   whether she has a boyfriend  her type and hobbies   explaining he dismissed hoshinomiya and chabashira as too flirtatious serious and picked ayanokoji as discreet and trustworthy   i want you to investigate her  as carefully and discreetly as possible   you re the only one who goes to the gym  remains discreet  and seems trustworthy  cheerful and dedicated to training but secretly smitten   he delegates a discreet investigation rather than confess himself  showing a calculating side behind the simple enthusiasm  gym buddy whom he trusts with a personal favor  the gym employee he is interested in  asks ayanokoji to investigate her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9_5-p15-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Mashima: gym training, and a favor to investigate Akiyama<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.15–23<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the gym he is pleased to find Ayanokōji is now a member, shows him his bench-press routine (80–100 kg, using safety bars), trains absorbed for two hours and accepts Ayanokōji&#x27;s advice to stop. In the break room he asks Ayanokōji to investigate a gym employee, Akiyama — whether she has a boyfriend, her type and hobbies — explaining he dismissed Hoshinomiya and Chabashira as too flirtatious/serious and picked Ayanokōji as discreet and trustworthy.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"akiyama.html\">Akiyama<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Hm? Ayanokōji? Are you a gym member too?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;When doing bench presses, never forget these safety bars.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I want you to investigate her. As carefully and discreetly as possible.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;re the only one who goes to the gym, remains discreet, and seems trustworthy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful and dedicated to training but secretly smitten — he delegates a discreet Investigation rather than confess himself, showing a calculating side behind the simple enthusiasm.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Gym buddy whom he trusts with a personal favor.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Akiyama<\/b> The gym employee he is interested in; asks Ayanokōji to investigate her.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v10-p9-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v10-p9-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.9-235<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v11-p11-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v11-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.11-223<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v12_5-p65-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari ch 4  ch 9 mentioned appears in ch 4  ch 9  appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v12_5-p65-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4, Ch.9<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.65-76, 194-203<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Mentioned/appears in Ch.4, Ch.9.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Appears in this volume.<span class=\"pg\">p.65-76, 194-203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"}];
